{"id":"610f23ee04365803","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-morphism.md","title":"Morphism","display":"df-morphism — Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-morphism","aliases":["58-df-morphism","Morphism"],"display":"df-morphism — Morphism","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-morphism</span><span>Morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-morphism — Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,f,g,u,a,b\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,f,g,u,a,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>（六元组范畴码的规范投影）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span>（范畴结构谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Morphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Morphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Composable}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Composable}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a,b\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a,b\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S(u,a,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land u=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(u,a,a,\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S(u,a,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land u=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(u,a,a,\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}composable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Composable}_S(g,f,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=s_{\\mathcal C}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}composable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Composable}_S(g,f,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=s_{\\mathcal C}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(g,b,a,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=e_{\\mathcal C}(b)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(g,b,a,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=e_{\\mathcal C}(b)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>四个谓词都从同一个六元组范畴码取对象、态射、源靶、复合与单位，因而不存在隐藏的外部结构参数。</li>\n<li>单位态射谓词现在对任意候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 给出充要条件，而不只约束形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(a)\">\\(e(a)\\)</span> 的输入。</li>\n<li>morphism 是带有源与靶的箭头；在具体范畴中才表现为保持结构的函数。</li>\n<li>monomorphism 与 epimorphism 由左右消去律定义，不应直接等同于集合函数的单射或满射。</li>\n<li>associativity 与所有单位律属于完整范畴结构公理；这里给出相关局部谓词。</li>\n<li>在完整范畴公理下，可复合的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,f\">\\(g,f\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ f:a\\to c\">\\(g\\circ f:a\\to c\\)</span>；这是由复合闭合性推出的定理，不作为 <code>Composable</code> 的定义子句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,f,g,u,a,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C),s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Morphism}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Composable}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a,b\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=a\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=b.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}identity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IdentityMorphism}_S(u,a,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land u=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(u,a,a,\\mathcal C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}composable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Composable}_S(g,f,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=s_{\\mathcal C}(g).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,a,b,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(g,b,a,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=e_{\\mathcal C}(a)\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=e_{\\mathcal C}(b)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"e(a)","display":false},{"tex":"g,f","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ f:a\\to c","display":false}],"bytes":2853,"backlinks":[{"id":"10d1013ea2b50503","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Morphism}_S\\subseteq V^4$（see [[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md]]）"},{"id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4$（see [[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md]]）"},{"id":"41289d25523036d5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)$ (morphism predicate with its category parameter, see [[58-df-morphism]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-860","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md|58-df-morphism]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c","e637becf421e4e61"]}